Class AIRunService:
- validate operation_context by run_type
- create run metadata with cache keys and optional bound session ownership checks
- short-circuit strong cache hits while still updating transcripts, leaderboard, and metrics
- execute the LangGraph pipeline with optional provider/model overrides
- write ai_runs metadata and run artifacts
- update cache, leaderboard, transcripts, metrics, and structured logs after completion
- expose background streaming execution that emits run_started, tool_event, message_delta, run_completed, and run_failed
